// binaries, SHA256SUMS checked) driven by rust-dashcore contrib/node/dde-probe
// bs7_probe.py, rendered by gen_bs7_corpus.py. "pin" names the release.
// Payloads over 4 KiB are lists of hex and {"b": byte, "n": count} runs.
